---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="The engineering approach behind Isac Zarate and TheDevIsacZ." pathname="/about/">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Full-stack perspective. Quality-engineering discipline.</h1><p class="lede">I approach software as both a user experience and a system that must stay dependable as it changes.</p></header>
  <section class="section section-grid">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Working approach</p><h2>Useful software deserves a strong feedback loop.</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>My focus brings implementation and verification into the same conversation: clarify observable behavior, choose maintainable boundaries, and exercise the paths that matter to users.</p>
      <p>This first release intentionally avoids unsupported employment details or outcomes. The professional timeline and individual project evidence will appear after they are reviewed against source material.</p>
      <h2>What this portfolio demonstrates</h2>
      <ul><li>Typed, content-driven frontend architecture with minimal client JavaScript.</li><li>Accessibility, browser behavior, and truthful fallbacks treated as requirements.</li><li>Infrastructure and delivery modeled as code without making implicit cloud changes.</li></ul>
      {siteConfig.github && <p><a class="text-link" href={siteConfig.github} rel="me">Review the source on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
